{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation detail for this story (exact edit list; the description carries the decisions). Line numbers are on origin/main 2e81cb9767c1.\n\n4. `signature_findings` (`src/rebar/_engine_support/validate.py:70-142`): delete the `signing_key` try-block and `_NO_KEY` short-circuit (`:87-92`), drop `key=key` (`:124`); keep `mismatch -> major`, `foreign_key -> minor`; add `invalid` and `key_not_valid_at_era -> major`; `unsigned` and `certified` stay silent. Rewrite the docstring (`:71-81`).\n5. `_gen_local_files` (`src/rebar/_commands/init.py:480-495`): delete the `.signing-key` mint and the `import uuid` (`init.py:23`, sole use at `:491`); reword the comment to the `.closure-key` precedent (\"no longer minted; stays gitignored\"). Keep `.signing-key` in `src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py:48` `_GITIGNORE` (existing stores carry the file; `.closure-key` at `:47` is the precedent).\n6. Keep `src/rebar/reducer/_present.py::_strip_hex` (`:56-70`): folded SNAPSHOTs still carry the hex and `rebar show` must strip it. Keep the nullable `signature`/`key_id` in `src/rebar/schemas/sign_result.schema.json:19-20` (read tolerance; reword \"RETIRED (story 8f1d)\" to \"RETIRED (2026-09): never emitted; pre-retirement records only\") and the `ticket_state.signature` mirror (operator ruling; `src/rebar/schemas/ticket_state.schema.json:164` prose \"the raw HMAC hex is stripped\" stays true).\n7. Docstring and prose sweep (no behaviour): `src/rebar/_signing_manifest.py:69-71`, `src/rebar/attest/__init__.py:7-12`, `src/rebar/attest/registry.py:22-24`, `src/rebar/attest/opcert.py:29-33,342`, `src/rebar/_opcert_signing.py:32`, `src/rebar/_mcp_reads.py:567-571`, `src/rebar/_store/env_identity.py:14,188,276`, `src/rebar/_lib_identity.py:198`, `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/attest_gate.py:186` (\"HMAC verify\" to \"op-cert verify\"), `src/rebar/reducer/llm_format.py:111`, `src/rebar/schemas/verify_signature_result.schema.json:5,20`.\n8. Docs: `docs/manifest-signing.md:56-60` becomes \"Legacy HMAC records (retired 2026-09)\": any `signature`-bearing record verifies `unsigned` with the retired reason; `docs/reuse-surface.md:144-155` delete \"Generic HMAC primitives\" and fix `:3,89,125,134`; `docs/attest-substrate.md:161-167`, `docs/plan-review-gate.md:593,1726`, `docs/repo-snapshot-gates.md:154` (`unknown_scheme` to `unsigned`; keep the sentence containing \"HMAC-SHA256\" so `tests/unit/test_snapshot_docs.py:45-48` still passes), `docs/event-schema.md:51` (drop \"`verify_record` retains generic HMAC verification\"), `docs/exit-codes.md:202` (drop \"or, for a legacy HMAC record, a missing key\"), `docs/config.md:805` (drop `REBAR_SIGNING_KEY`), `docs/migrations/hmac-opcert-removal.md` (append \"## Retirement (2026-09)\" after `:85`; sections asserted by `tests/unit/test_hmac_opcert_removal_8f1d.py:179` stay), `docs/env-vars.md` regenerated with `python scripts/gen_env_registry.py` (the `REBAR_SIGNING_KEY` row at `:152` disappears).\n9. Baselines: `python scripts/gen_api_surface.py --update` (drops the entries at `tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json:3632,3670,3713,3723,3755,3766,3782,3846,3989` plus `verify_record`); `python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --check` passes (removed `env_var::REBAR_SIGNING_KEY` buckets as `stale`); `tests/golden/config_surface.json:17` `identity.signing_key` is the SSH authorship key and is untouched.\n10. ADR amendments. ADR 0044, append after the Context at `:10-13`: \"Amendment (2026-09): the symmetric HMAC model this ADR replaced is now fully retired: `src/rebar/_signing_hmac.py`, `REBAR_SIGNING_KEY` and `<tracker>/.signing-key` no longer exist; a non-envelope SIGNATURE record verifies `unsigned` with reason `legacy HMAC scheme retired (2026-09)`. The substrate below is the only signing path.\" ADR 0049, append to section 10 at `:176-182`: \"Contract completed (2026-09): the read-both window closed. `verify_attestation_record` dispatches envelope to the SSHSIG verifier and anything else to `signing.retired_scheme_verdict` (`unsigned`). No key custody remains for HMAC; a project holding a pre-2026-07-15 attestation on an open ticket re-runs the gate once (`rebar review-plan <id>`), the worst case being one re-review.\"\n\nTests to DELETE: `tests/unit/test_signing.py` HMAC functions (`:50-76`, `:91-160`, `:167-253`, `:257-311`; keep `:21-42`, `:84`, `:314`, `:331`; rewrite `:110-133` onto `retired_scheme_verdict`); `tests/unit/test_signing_module_split.py` (`:52-63` `MOVED_TO_HMAC`, `:74`, `:109-113` HMAC half, `:135-147`; drop `_signing_hmac.py` from the parametrize lists at `:150` and `:166`); `tests/unit/test_hmac_opcert_removal_8f1d.py::test_generic_hmac_utility_still_works_for_non_opcert` (`:99`); `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_signature.py::test_injected_env_key_round_trips` (`:146-153`) and `::test_readonly_verify_does_not_mint_key` (`:257-267`); `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_attested_signing.py::test_payload_version_unchanged` (`:57-58`); `tests/scripts/test_residual_drain_seam_clean_heldout.py::test_signing_key_env_injection_is_preserved` (`:187-193`); `tests/unit/test_canonical_consolidation.py` (`:43-49`, `:110-111`, `:136-146`); `tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py::test_signing_key_keeps_restrictive_mode` (`:202-205`); `tests/unit/test_api_surface_gate.py:311-314`.\n\nTests to REWRITE: `test_hmac_opcert_removal_8f1d.py`: `_write_legacy_hmac_opcert` (`:116`) builds the record as a literal; `:148` `unknown_scheme` becomes `unsigned` plus `\"retired\" in reason`; these survive as the new contract: `:52`, `:62`, `:75` (registry has no HMAC scheme), `:88` (sign_manifest emits no `signature`/`key_id`), `:154` (record byte-unchanged on disk), `:164` (re-running the gate certifies), `:179`, `:195`. `tests/unit/test_opcert_producer_seam_8d8e.py:308-324` literalise plus `unsigned`; delete `:398-405`. `tests/unit/test_opcert_storage_heldout.py:98-118` literalise, `:148` becomes `unsigned`. `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_attestations_integration.py:166` assert `unsigned`. `test_signature.py:187-226` build the two racing events with `sign_manifest`. `test_attested_signing.py:86-96` compare two `sign_manifest` envelopes. `tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py:188` drop `.signing-key`. `tests/_topology_template.py:20` and `tests/interfaces/_store_template.py:30` drop the `.signing-key` tuple. `tests/unit/store/test_stamped_lock.py:340` remove the `\"_signing_hmac.py\": 2` key.\n\nTests to TOUCH (delete one `monkeypatch.setenv(\"REBAR_SIGNING_KEY\", ...)` line each): the 34 files listed by `git grep -ln 'REBAR_SIGNING_KEY' -- tests` (for example `tests/unit/_audit_page_helpers.py:29`, `tests/unit/test_fixture_heal.py:53`, `tests/integration/reviewbot_convergence_support.py:64`).\n\nTests untouched: `test_mcp_auth_jwks.py` (JWT), `test_check_ssm_secret_state.py`, `test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py`, `test_identity_ts3_117b*.py` (`identity.signing_key` is the SSH authorship key; the enum at `:247-266` is unchanged), `test_attest_registry_heldout.py:79`, `test_opcert_cross_environment_c21f.py`, `test_attestations_reducer.py:23` and `test_legacy_signature_mirror_drop.py:25` (opaque legacy shapes; keep).\n\nNEW `tests/unit/test_hmac_retirement.py`: fixture reused from `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_attestations_integration.py:150-180` (`append_event(resolved, \"SNAPSHOT\", {\"compiled_state\": ..., \"source_event_uuids\": ..., \"compacted_at\": 1}, tracker)`), with `compiled_state[\"attestations\"][\"plan-review\"]` set to the exact live shape of `.tickets-tracker/003d-e6b0-9e58-4b52/1785993218769510001-a91e47c6-880d-42f5-b492-247181da8bf3-SNAPSHOT.json`: keys `algorithm: \"HMAC-SHA256\"`, `author`, `head_sha`, `key_id: \"412fa5372ad877e0\"`, `kind: \"plan-review\"`, `manifest: [\"plan-review: PASS\", \"ticket: <id>\", \"material: 5e6cba9142ddb7e2\", ..., \"verified-at-sha:2272d68c...\"]`, `signature: <64 hex>`, `signed_at: 1783806358702652000`. Tests: (a) `reduce_ticket` returns the map and `rebar.show_ticket` renders `attestations[\"plan-review\"]` without `signature`; (b) `rebar verify-signature <id> --kind plan-review --output json` exits 1 with `verdict == \"unsigned\"`, `reason` containing `\"legacy HMAC scheme retired\"`, `key_id == \"412fa5372ad877e0\"`, `step_count == len(manifest)`; (c) `plan_review_status(id)` returns `verdict == \"unsigned\"` and the reason text (via `attest_gate.py:136-147`); (d) `signature_findings(tracker)` returns `[]`; (e) `monkeypatch.setenv(\"REBAR_SIGNING_KEY\", \"x\")` changes nothing and `scripts/gen_env_registry.py --check` stays green; (f) `test_no_hmac_readers_remain`: `git grep -E 'signing_key\\(|REBAR_SIGNING_KEY|compute_signature|verify_record\\b' -- src` is empty."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788805580885763069,"uuid":"01a6d479-4e8b-4409-90f6-655d8045ec6a"}